person","heading":"Meet your puppy in person","body":"Step into our Downtown Dubai showroom and experience the joy of choosing your puppy face-to-face. We source healthy, well-socialized puppies from trusted local breeders, ensuring they're raised with care, proper nutrition, and veterinary checks.","steps":[{"text":"Browse our website to view the available puppies. Each listing includes photos, breed details, age, and health information.","title":"Explore our puppies"},{"text":"Once you find a puppy you love, open their profile for more information or to enquire further. You can also reach out to us directly if you have any questions.","title":"Choose your puppy"},{"text":"Spend time bonding before making your decision.","title":"Meet before you choose"},{"text":"Pick up your puppy from us or have them delivered to your home within Dubai. Our delivery service is safe and reliable, ensuring your puppy arrives comfortably.","title":"Pick-up or delivery"}]},{"key":"imported","label":"Imported","hint":"order upon request","heading":"Order upon request","body":"Looking for a truly exceptional companion? Our Order Upon Request service gives you access to some of the world's most sought-after teacup breeds â€” ethically sourced from the most reputable, certified breeders across Europe, Korea, and beyond.","note":"From Korean teacup poodles to rare Maltese, Pom, and Yorkie lines, we bring the world's finest puppies to Dubai, just for you.","steps":[{"text":"Browse our selection of available breeds and place a reservation for the teacup puppy that captures your heart. Our reservation-only model ensures that each puppy is specifically sourced to meet your preferences.","title":"Reserve your puppy"},{"text":"Once your reservation is confirmed, we will work closely with you to finalize details and provide updates on your puppy's journey.","title":"Personalized consultation"},{"text":"We manage all aspects of the import process, including health checks, travel arrangements, and necessary documentation. Your puppy will be carefully transported and will arrive ready to join your family.","title":"Import and arrival"},{"text":"Upon arrival, we provide support to help your new puppy acclimate to their new environment. Our team is available for any additional assistance and to ensure a smooth transition into your home.","title":"Welcome home"}]}]}]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14"]}],false]}]}],["$L15"],"$L16"]}],"p":"$@17","v":"$18","s":"$9"}}]]
